      "note": "`sync-skills.py` copies only `REPO_ROOT/\"skills\"` into its fixed targets, so `dev-skills/` is outside this distribution flow. Checking compares the canonical tree with target contents, so an independently copied dev-skill inside a checked target can be reported as extra; this does not inspect the `dev-skills/` source tree.\n\nAnchor: `CANONICAL_SKILLS` `TARGETS` `diff_target` `sync_target` `check_targets`",
